{"slug":"advancing-bc-homes-housing-needs-in-chilliwack-and-mission-8243023","path":"/blog.html/advancing-bc-homes-housing-needs-in-chilliwack-and-mission-8243023","url":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/advancing-bc-homes-housing-needs-in-chilliwack-and-mission-8243023","kind":"blog","title":"Advancing B.C. Homes: Housing Needs in Chilliwack and Mission","canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/advancing-bc-homes-housing-needs-in-chilliwack-and-mission-8243023","seo":{"Title":"Advancing B.C. Homes: Housing Needs in Chilliwack and Mission","Meta description":"Under a provincial plan to boost housing, Chilliwack and Mission will get new housing targets to help add homes in these growing Fraser Valley cities.","H1":"Bank of Canada Reduces Policy Rate by 25 Basis Points","Canonical":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/advancing-bc-homes-housing-needs-in-chilliwack-and-mission-8243023","Meta robots":"","OG title":" Bank of Canada Reduces Policy Rate by 25 Basis Points","OG description":"Under a provincial plan to boost housing, Chilliwack and Mission will get new housing targets to help add homes in these growing Fraser Valley cities.","OG image":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/wps/rest/64736/blog/hbwh/hbwhkbqjlfyu.jpeg","Published":"2024-03-28T15:42:00+00:00","Modified":"2026-02-06T11:25:07+00:00"},"blocks":[{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"RSS","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.feed"}]},{"t":"h","level":1,"text":"Bank of Canada Reduces Policy Rate by 25 Basis Points"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posted on"},{"t":"March 28, 2024"},{"t":"by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/about.html"}],"cls":"byline"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Chilliwack","h":"https://www.chilliwack.com/main/page.cfm?id=2269"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"Mission","h":"https://www.mission.ca/business-building/land-development-planning"},{"t":", along with 18 other communities in British Columbia’s high-growth areas, will receive housing targets this summer as part of the Homes for B.C. action plan."}]},{"t":"h","level":4,"text":"Building upon Progress: The Second Round of Housing Targets"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"This marks the second round of cities identified for housing targets, aiming to increase housing density across the province. Notable inclusions are Chilliwack, Mission, Langley, and Maple Ridge."}]},{"t":"h","level":4,"text":"Collaborative Efforts: Municipalities and Provincial Support"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Housing Minister","h":"https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/governments/organizational-structure/ministries-organizations/ministries/housing"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Ravi Kahon emphasizes the importance of communities building on their existing efforts to address housing challenges. The province will closely support municipalities in meeting their housing targets, facilitating the construction of much-needed homes."}]},{"t":"h","level":4,"text":"Legislative Support and Funding Initiatives"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"New legislation under the"},{"t":"B.C. Homes for People","h":"https://news.gov.bc.ca/releases/2023HOUS0019-000436"},{"t":"action plan includes provisions for designated Transit-Oriented Areas, updated Official Community Plans, and streamlined approval processes. Financial support includes the historic $1-billion Growing Communities Fund and grants for housing-related activities."}]},{"t":"h","level":4,"text":"Promoting Affordability and Rental Options"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"The Housing Supply Act is a key component of the Province’s Homes for People action plan, aimed at increasing housing availability and curbing speculation. These efforts are crucial for addressing the housing crisis and promoting rental options for British Columbians."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Written by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/contact.html"},{"t":"– Top 1% Realtor in the Fraser Valley."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Blogs"},{"t":"All Blog Posts","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"New Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86690"}],[{"t":"Open Houses","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86691"}],[{"t":"Real Estate Blog","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=82607"}],[{"t":"Sold Listings","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html?blog=86692"}]]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Posts By Date"},{"t":"Most Recent","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html"}]},{"t":"list","items":[[{"t":"October 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/10/"}],[{"t":"September 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/09/"}],[{"t":"August 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/08/"}],[{"t":"July 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/07/"}],[{"t":"June 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/06/"}],[{"t":"May 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/05/"}],[{"t":"April 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/04/"}],[{"t":"March 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/03/"}],[{"t":"February 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/02/"}],[{"t":"January 2026","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2026/01/"}],[{"t":"December 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/12/"}],[{"t":"November 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/11/"}],[{"t":"October 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/10/"}],[{"t":"September 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/09/"}],[{"t":"August 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/08/"}],[{"t":"July 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/07/"}],[{"t":"June 2025","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/blog.html/blog.html/archives/2025/06/"}],[{"t":"M